    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的真人家庭情感短片，真人影像\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical true human family emotion short film, real footage).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The overall visual quality is solid with clear detail in faces, hair, and clothing.\n- Lighting is natural and consistent, with good contrast between subjects and background.\n- Depth of field is well-managed, keeping the subjects in focus while the background remains softly rendered.\n- Transitions are smooth and there are no obvious artifacts or distortions.\n- Color grading is warm and cohesive across scenes.\n- Overall, Visual Quality aligns with a high-but-not-perfect level (score around 4).\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video largely matches the prompt: it is a 15-second, 9:16 vertical format, featuring two adult women in an indoor setting, with visible interaction and genuine expressions.\n- The scene conveys a family/emotional moment through body language and proximity.\n- There are minor deviations from the exact prompt (e.g., the setting appears more like a modern interior rather than a traditional home environment), but these do not significantly detract from alignment.\n- Overall alignment is strong and consistent with a score of 4.\n\nPhysical Consistency / Common-sense:\n- Movements and interactions feel natural; lighting and shadows are coherent with the environment.\n- No obvious physics violations or implausible elements; spatial relationships remain believable throughout.\n- Some very minor timing nuances may exist, but they do not undermine overall realism.\n- Overall, Physical Consistency is solid (score around 4).\n\nGround-truth scores: Visual Quality = 4; Text-to-Video Alignment = 4; Physical Consistency = 4.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense c